- Vogelstein und Rieger, Gesch. der Jud. in Rom, ii. passim, Berlin, 1895;
- Berliner, Gesch. der Jud. in Rom. ii. 2, passim, Frankfort-on-the-Main, 1893;
- Abrahams, Jewish Life in the Middle Ages, p. 46, London, 1896.

